  "answer": "To scale up vLLM service to multiple replicas in SkyPilot, you can add a `replicas` section to the YAML file, specifying the number of replicas and setting the `target_qps_per_replica` to a value that ensures the service scales appropriately. This is done by modifying the `service` section of the YAML configuration file. Additionally, you can use the `replica_policy` to define the minimum and maximum number of replicas and the target QPS per replica."
